  "raw_label": "postponed_or_procedural",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mahesh Soni vs The Assistant Commissioner Of Police on 27 December, 2024 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 27.12.2024 Coram The Honourable Mrs Justice L.Victoria Gowri W.P. No.39716 of 2024 and WMP.No.43012 of 2024 Mahesh Soni ..Petition Vs. 1. The Assistant Commissioner of Police, Valluvar Kottam High Road, Ponnangipuram, Nungambakkam, Chennai-6. 2. The Inspector of Police, F-3, Police station, Ponnangipuram, Nungambakkam, Chennai-6. .. Respond Prayer: Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of Ind issuance of Writ of Mandamus forbearing the second respondent from interfering in relation to the running of their Restaurant premise Brew Cafe along with Herbal Hookah Services (without any content or trace of Tobacco and Nicotine) at No.38/11 Status Quo building, Ste Road, Nungambakkam, Chennai-600 034. 1 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis For Petitioner : Mr.S.R.Rajagopal, Sr.C. For M/s.Praveenath Selvam For Respondents : Mr. K.M.D.Muhilan, Government Advocate (Crl. Side) Order",
    "facts": "This writ petition has been filed seeking to forbear the second respondent from interfering in relation to the running of their Restaurant premise viz., DEJA BREW CAFE along with Herbal Mahesh Soni vs The Assistant Commissioner Of Police on 27 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/70968451/ 1 Hookah Services (without any content or trace of Tobacco and Nicotine) at No.38/11, Status Quo building, Sterling Road, Nungambakkam, Chennai-600 034. 2.",
    "arguments": "The learned Senior Counsel appearing for the petitioner submitted that the petitioner is ready to give an undertaking that he will allot a separate smoking area for serving of Herbal Hookah Services (without any content or trace of Tobacco and Nicotine) in his business premises. 3. Per contra, the learned Government Advocate appearing for the respondents submitted that even if they provide separate smoking space, the https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis permission under the Department of Food Safety is mandated."
  },
